  "fullDescription": "Level up your designs with retro 8-bit nostalgia, Y2K digital flair, and authentic arcade aesthetic with MODULE 24! Built as a crisp, pixelated display typeface, it combines sharp grid-based geometry with distinct slab serif details. It captures the perfect balance between classic vintage gaming graphics and modern tech-driven typography, turning your titles into standout digital statements.\n\nIdeal for retro video game UI, tech startup branding, cyber aesthetic posters, pixel art graphics, streaming channel overlays, and futuristic streetwear designs!",
